{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update - 25.11.2025</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>: I\u2019m gathering feedback and gradually expanding the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project will be <strong>regularly updated with new chapters</strong> and content - this is part of my long-term development roadmap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, the game includes the <strong>\u201cPool Rooms\u201d chapter</strong>, with an average playtime of <strong>\u2248 45\u201360 minutes</strong>. I will be <strong>adding new sections and details</strong> to this chapter over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is still minimalistic: there is a <strong>simple menu</strong> with basic settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current settings include <strong>image quality adjustment</strong> and a <strong>frame rate slider</strong> to help tailor performance to your device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>expanded settings menu</strong> (with additional options and improvements) is still in development and will be released <strong>within the next few weeks</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can think of this game as an atmospheric installation where you don\u2019t so much <i>play</i> as observe, listen, and gradually sink into the space. There are no quests or puzzles - only occasional moments that require attention. Most of the time, you simply\u2026 exist within a strange, enveloping world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: the atmosphere may feel oppressive. The game plays on fears of getting lost, darkness, emptiness, and endless rooms. There are no dialogues or music - only distant echoes and the natural sounds of the environment. Movement across certain surfaces can be slower, making the experience more realistic and heightening the tension. There is no traditional story, yet the environment slowly changes, revealing new spaces and hidden meaning in each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As of now (25.11.2025), the game includes one large chapter, which takes approximately 45\u201360 minutes to complete.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"NoClip Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/1d93bbdeb46911fbb49bb8ac3170fdcfe0cca342.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Breath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/b4cc7d30bf02590ec25fe78d7b87dad1163ffa94.jpg"},{"name":"The Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/c9b52b967887bc6fa619d25ae09e5aeb458a2120.jpg"},{"name":"Curiosity Isn\u2019t a Sin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/e02cbc616d6dc9942e9f9fa0ba87c69cc4f5452a.jpg"},{"name":"Tester of the Year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/8a881e1e46fff9c10eba010ac434586ee9bbd4fc.jpg"},{"name":"Fearless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/be2e3f6474ccaad331d42b23d796503855172887.jpg"},{"name":"To the Very End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/6d8c7635fefdaa3a71699f27c6a726122e3eb5c0.jpg"},{"name":"Seeker of... uh... Tenants","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/3d71ab1931643a9fe908cf52766752ad35aa9b2d.jpg"},{"name":"Archivarius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/f1ec0bc6046e43c4c2c6e4411f983bee5cf2ac18.jpg"},{"name":"Elevator Fever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3301970/8f8095cd540464047cbc78cbc5446248284f6df8.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3301970?t=1764151463","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764151463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/bff4c6b346d0966a6372369ee91dd13ff853a74c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764151463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/bff4c6b346d0966a6372369ee91dd13ff853a74c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764151463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Update - 25.11.2025</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>: I\u2019m gathering feedback and gradually expanding the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project will be <strong>regularly updated with new chapters</strong> and content - this is part of my long-term development roadmap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the moment, the game includes the <strong>\u201cPool Rooms\u201d chapter</strong>, with an average playtime of <strong>\u2248 45\u201360 minutes</strong>. I will be <strong>adding new sections and details</strong> to this chapter over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The interface is still minimalistic: there is a <strong>simple menu</strong> with basic settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current settings include <strong>image quality adjustment</strong> and a <strong>frame rate slider</strong> to help tailor performance to your device.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>expanded settings menu</strong> (with additional options and improvements) is still in development and will be released <strong>within the next few weeks</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can think of this game as an atmospheric installation where you don\u2019t so much <i>play</i> as observe, listen, and gradually sink into the space. There are no quests or puzzles - only occasional moments that require attention. Most of the time, you simply\u2026 exist within a strange, enveloping world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: the atmosphere may feel oppressive. The game plays on fears of getting lost, darkness, emptiness, and endless rooms. There are no dialogues or music - only distant echoes and the natural sounds of the environment. Movement across certain surfaces can be slower, making the experience more realistic and heightening the tension. There is no traditional story, yet the environment slowly changes, revealing new spaces and hidden meaning in each area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As of now (25.11.2025), the game includes one large chapter, which takes approximately 45\u201360 minutes to complete.</p>","developers":["Torna Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301970/2be6e6a09b1c0a6a713e25d7f8b14e5de9b37215/header.jpg?t=1764151463","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3301970/1721490565/b9157034ab0284a306e4982141c8ef8d1a82a549/1764021962/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764080526","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3301970/1721490565/b9157034ab0284a306e4982141c8ef8d1a82a549/1764021962/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764080526","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3301970/1721490565/b9157034ab0284a306e4982141c8ef8d1a82a549/1764021962/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764080526","id":257237361,"n